  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n691 × 709 = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a - b)(a + b) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n691 × 709 = (700 - 9)(700 + 9)\n\n⇒ 691 × 709 = 700² - 9²\n\n⇒ 691 × 709 = 490000 - 81\n\n⇒ 691 × 709 = 489919\n\n**∴ 691 × 709 = 489919.**",
